{
  "label": "day56",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label day56:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice0",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice0.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice0"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And so begins another lonely day in the office.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Upon thinking more about it, this whole ‘guidance counselor’ thing doesn’t really make sense to me, to be honest.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Most days, I just find myself sitting here for an hour or two before calling it quits and going home.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sure, there are rare occasions where someone will actually stop by...but I think only one of those occasions has actually involved counseling so far.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Two, maybe- if you count being blown off by Yumi as counseling. Which I do not.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Welp, it looks like someone else is here to take advantage of both my office hours and a position I am absolutely not qualified for.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Come in.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "show mayaoffice1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice1.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And...it looks like it's someone entirely unexpected.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean “Huh?” Am I not allowed to use this office for the same unintended purposes everyone else uses it for?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That depends on whether or not you are here for a shoulder massage.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice1r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice1r.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice1r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? Ew. No.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that seriously what you've been using this place for?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...No.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're disgusting...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, what brings you here today, Maya?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not often you actually come to see me. In fact, I’m pretty sure that this is the first time this has ever happened.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice1.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That is correct. And don't take my arrival here as some sort of omen for things to come. I would like to clarify first and foremost that I absolutely do not want to be here right now.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, that's a good start to this conversation.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The fact of the matter is, if I didn’t remind you of something soon, horrible things would likely follow.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...ominous.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is truly ominous is your existence and all of the horrible things that occur because of it.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, how is this new world treating you?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You mean the world that I have been in forever?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. I mean the one that you continuously deny that you’ve been reborn into even though we both know that is not the case.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm just going to assume you mean the world I've been in forever- which has been pretty good so far, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing strange has happened?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if roomwithtrack == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...I wouldn’t say that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice2.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please clarify.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I think I’ve been having some strange dreams lately.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You think?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...they feel like dreams, but I’m not really sure if that's what they are or not.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Dreams of what, exactly?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That...is kind of hard to explain.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you try? I'm actually curious now.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I am completely aware of how insane this will make me sound...but do you know anything about a...sort of...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Room with clocks?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice1.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There are many rooms with clocks in them. I’m not sure which one you’re talking about.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, like...one room with way too many clocks.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice3.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Were they like...different kinds of clocks or something?...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because I'm really confused about why something that unremarkable would be the first thing you go to in order to quantify how strange this world is.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There was other stuff that happened in the dream. It's all...blurry for the most part. But I remember seeing someone who looked a lot like you there.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice4.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. Wonderful. So it was that type of dream.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It really wasn't. In fact, I will confirm right now that I didn't even touch dream-Maya.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you...want a medal for that or something?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. But some acknowledgement that I'm not as bad as you say I am would be nice.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you forgetting the part roughly one minute ago where you admitted to molesting a girl in this very office?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Massage. Not molest.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry, how old are you again?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I honestly don't know.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then I will answer for you- old enough for there to be no difference between massage and molest. Now, can we please get back to the aspects of your dream that don't involve touching me?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There is no winning with this girl.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fine. What else do you want to know?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice1.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To start, are there any other important details you remember about this dream? Or was it just...clocks and me?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The thing is I don't even know if it was you. She was identical, but I...remember her acting very...different from how you typically act.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How depressing that you must resort to dreams of me being nice to you since it will never happen in real life.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, you know what? I don't think I'm going to talk about that dream anymore since it was clearly just some...ridiculous and random REM-induced brain voyage.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's probably a good call. But that aside, has anything else strange happened?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if letterttrack == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": One more thing. But it's going to make me sound strange again.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can assure you I am quite used to that by now.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then...how do you feel about the letter T?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice3.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Told you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What does the letter T have to do with anything? Is that...some sort of code?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. Well, at least I don’t think it is.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not really sure.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just vaguely remember something about that letter recently. But I feel like it's...a memory I'm not really supposed to have? Does that make any sense?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not really...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, what relevancy would that have to me? Asking me how I feel implies that I have something to do with this, doesn't it?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Dream-Maya was there again.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is she just in all of your dreams now? Because that is quite sickening and does not make me feel very safe.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I wouldn’t worry too much about it...It's probably just more meaningless brain vomit.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice4.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I sincerely hope that is true for the sake of both of us.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, did anything else happen? Or is that it?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...No? I don’t think so at least?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What about with you? We’re in the counseling room. So if you have any issues, this is the best place to air them out.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice3.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...I can promise you that if I did have any issues, you’d be one of the last people I'd go to for help.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": One of? So I’m not in last place?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice1.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Second to last. I wouldn’t celebrate just yet.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...who is last then?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That would have to be God.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aren’t you a shrine maiden?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Only because I have to be.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You...have to be a shrine maiden?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's very complicated. You wouldn't understand.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then I think you’re going to have to tell me more about it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please don’t tell me what I have to do. That sort of methodology might work on Ami and Ayane, but not me.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t mean that you literally have to...I’m just curious.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I am very sorry, but this is one of many cases in life where you'll just have to remain curious.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice4r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice4r.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice4r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": For now, though...let me get to the real reason I’m here.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, right. You said you wanted to remind me of something, correct?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Correct, but before I remind you, there is something I would like to ask. And I’d appreciate it if you would answer as honestly as possible.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...uhh, sure. What’s up?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayaoffice1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayaoffice1.webp",
      "alt": "mayaoffice1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you happy here?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You mean...Kumon-mi?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": More or less.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why exactly would Maya care about something as trivial as my happiness?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This isn't some sort of trick question, is it?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Regardless...she did ask me to answer as honestly as possible...",
